 Slovak politics.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>21 Feb 2018</span><span>Veľká Mača, Slovakia</span><span>Homicide</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-jan-kuciak.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-jan-kuciak.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="marielle-franco"><span class="label">2018 · Political activist · Militia conflict</span><h3>Marielle Franco</h3><p>Franco challenged police violence, militia power, racism, and corruption in Rio de Janeiro. Her death became a global symbol of resistance to militia and state violence.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>14 Mar 2018</span><span>Rio de Janeiro, Brazil</span><span>Homicide</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-marielle-franco.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-marielle-franco.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="jamal-khashoggi"><span class="label">2018 · Journalist · State assassination</span><h3>Jamal Khashoggi</h3><p>Khashoggi criticised Saudi leadership and was developing independent media and civil-society projects. His death reshaped global scrutiny of Saudi power, arms relationships, and transnational repression.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>2 Oct 2018</span><span>Istanbul, Turkey</span><span>Homicide and state operation</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-jamal-khashoggi.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-jamal-khashoggi.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article></div></section><section class="section wrap"><h2>Year Pattern Boundary</h2><article class="card"><p>Shared dates, institutions, investigators, lawyers, beneficiaries, or security failures are leads for comparison. A pattern does not establish coordination.</p></article></section><script type="application/json" id="compatibility-marker-vault" data-cleanup-marker="deep-cleanup">{"status":"compatibility-routes-preserved-with-clean-public-copy","checked":"2026-08-03","routes":["downloads/forum-posts.json","downloads/forum-posts.md","feed-center.html","share-center.html","launch-room.html","offer-center.html","source-document-vault.html","evidence-vault.html","black-file.html"]}</script></main><footer class="footer wrap"><p><strong>THE DEATH FILES</strong> — evidence first, conclusion second.</p><p class="warning">Inclusion does not imply murder, conspiracy, or wrongdoing by any connected person. Official findings, established evidence, disputed claims, analytical inference, and speculation are displayed separately.</p></footer></div><script src="matrix.js"></script><script src="death-files.js"></script></body></html>